{"n":107,"ar":"الماعون","tr":"Al-Ma'un","en":"The Small kindnesses","type":"meccan","verses":[[1,"أَرَءَيۡتَ ٱلَّذِي يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","Araayta allathee yukaththibu bialddeeni","Hast thou observed him who belieth religion"],[2,"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِي يَدُعُّ ٱلۡيَتِيمَ","Fathalika allathee yaduAAAAu alyateema","That is he who repelleth the orphan"],[3,"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلۡمِسۡكِينِ","Wala yahuddu AAala taAAami almiskeeni","And urgeth not the feeding of the needy"],[4,"فَوَيۡلٞ لِّلۡمُصَلِّينَ","Fawaylun lilmusalleena","Ah, woe unto worshippers"],[5,"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمۡ عَن صَلَاتِهِمۡ سَاهُونَ","Allatheena hum AAan salatihim sahoona","Who are heedless of their prayer"],[6,"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمۡ يُرَآءُونَ","Allatheena hum yuraoona","Who would be seen (at worship)"],[7,"وَيَمۡنَعُونَ ٱلۡمَاعُونَ","WayamnaAAoona almaAAoona","Yet refuse small kindnesses"]]}